"too (not just on sale.order) so this document can be found by pack id "
"directly, without first having to open its sale order. Found in practice "
"2026-09-08: a resale pack can be invoiced as ONE document covering every "
"sibling order, so searching by pack id is often the only way to see "
"'everything for this cart'."
msgstr ""

