"                    optional, but each row needs at least one of\n"
"                    Invoice ID/Order ID. If Invoice ID is present, the\n"
"                    invoice is imported (or located) via the API, same\n"
"                    as before. If Pack ID is also present (or only\n"
"                    Order ID + Pack ID are present, with no Invoice ID),\n"
"                    it's used only to relate the already-existing\n"
"                    document to its sale — this never calls the API or\n"
"                    touches Status, which remains Mercado Libre's own\n"
"                    exclusive responsibility. You can re-upload the same\n"
"                    updated file as many times as needed."
msgstr ""

